{"4181350": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Wares & Wonders: Fantasy Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 4181350, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wares &amp; Wonders</strong> is a cozy first-person fantasy shop simulator where every customer and every item matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/6970739a67b00cc6cc7e52e2358bfd02.avif?t=1786906829\" alt=\"\"width=350 height=133 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customers, Not a Crowd</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The people of Mirapol come into your shop with a purpose. A cook may be looking for ingredients for a banquet, an adventurer for potions before setting out, and a dwarf for a blade they won't be ashamed to carry. What this visitor needs, though, you'll pick up from their words, habits, and reactions to your wares.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the habits of the locals — magical and otherwise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take their profession, their means, and what they need today into account.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember your regulars: next time, they may be looking for something completely different.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the city and run a shop people come back to — not just for goods, but with problems money can't solve.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/2c9a2c53404d31622b7732275ac83860.poster.avif?t=1786906829\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/2c9a2c53404d31622b7732275ac83860.webm?t=1786906829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/2c9a2c53404d31622b7732275ac83860.mp4?t=1786906829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Every Item Has Its Place</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     You do everything by hand here: carry it, set it down, move it around — and try not to break it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Weapons look better on racks, armor on mannequins, and jewelry behind glass. The right display helps an item find the right customer. A sword on the floor is still a sword, of course. It just doesn't make quite the same impression.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Good Business Starts with Paying Attention</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Notice what people are after — and why they leave empty-handed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose what to sell: one rare item can be worth more than a whole crate of common goods if the right buyer walks in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set and adjust your prices: events around the city can reshape demand in a single day.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change your displays, selection, and the quality of your stock: even the finest goods will gather dust on the shelves if customers never notice them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work the counter, grow your business, and hire helpers: decide who to trust with the register, the stockroom, or the garden.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/3526db9eeec9fe0e3063286969413d5a.poster.avif?t=1786906829\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/3526db9eeec9fe0e3063286969413d5a.webm?t=1786906829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/3526db9eeec9fe0e3063286969413d5a.mp4?t=1786906829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Beyond the Door, a Story Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Explore Mirapol, meet its residents, take on quests, and pick up rumors. A conversation with a merchant can help you learn more about an item, a strange request can lead to a new story, and a familiar face may come back with an order you'd never expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Find out why the shop ended up in your hands — and what you'll have to do to keep it from closing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/dae53ade2c5c670008d0bb61e4b5faf5.poster.avif?t=1786906829\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/dae53ade2c5c670008d0bb61e4b5faf5.webm?t=1786906829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/dae53ade2c5c670008d0bb61e4b5faf5.mp4?t=1786906829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>One Shop, Four Pairs of Hands</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Play alone or run a shared shop with friends. One player buys stock, another serves customers, while a third arranges the displays… and wrecks half the shop in the process, leaving the fourth plenty to do with a broom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     There's work for everyone: working the counter, buying stock, managing the stockroom, tending the garden, making deliveries, and running errands around the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/6970739a67b00cc6cc7e52e2358bfd02.avif?t=1786906829\" alt=\"\"width=350 height=133 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Everything can be picked up. Almost everything can be broken. Every new visitor comes in with something specific in mind. Figuring out exactly what — that's your job.<br>Shall we?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wares &amp; Wonders</strong> is a cozy first-person fantasy shop simulator where every customer and every item matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/6970739a67b00cc6cc7e52e2358bfd02.avif?t=1786906829\" alt=\"\"width=350 height=133 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Customers, Not a Crowd</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     The people of Mirapol come into your shop with a purpose. A cook may be looking for ingredients for a banquet, an adventurer for potions before setting out, and a dwarf for a blade they won't be ashamed to carry. What this visitor needs, though, you'll pick up from their words, habits, and reactions to your wares.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn the habits of the locals — magical and otherwise.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take their profession, their means, and what they need today into account.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remember your regulars: next time, they may be looking for something completely different.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_