ice them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work the counter, grow your business, and hire helpers: decide who to trust with the register, the stockroom, or the garden.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/3526db9eeec9fe0e3063286969413d5a.poster.avif?t=1786906829\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/3526db9eeec9fe0e3063286969413d5a.webm?t=1786906829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/3526db9eeec9fe0e3063286969413d5a.mp4?t=1786906829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Beyond the Door, a Story Begins</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Explore Mirapol, meet its residents, take on quests, and pick up rumors. A conversation with a merchant can help you learn more about an item, a strange request can lead to a new story, and a familiar face may come back with an order you'd never expect.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >     Find out why the shop ended up in your hands — and what you'll have to do to keep it from closing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/dae53ade2c5c670008d0bb61e4b5faf5.poster.avif?t=1786906829\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/dae53ade2c5c670008d0bb61e4b5faf5.webm?t=1786906829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4181350/extras/dae53ade2c5c670008d0b